{
  "components": [
    {
      "deviations": [
        "Shadow: one composited Direct2D shadow (blur sigma 4 DIP, +4 DIP y offset, 14 % alpha light / 30 % dark) instead of card shadow-sm (0 1px 3px / 0 1px 2px -1px at 10 %) — the bubble floats over arbitrary desktop content through a transparent DirectComposition window and needs stronger separation.",
        "Bare container: no CardHeader/CardContent/CardFooter slots and no 24 px card padding; Composer and Response own their insets.",
        "Radius 14 DIP, 1 DIP border (border token) and card fill match card (14 px, 1 px, #E5E5E5 / #FFFFFF; dark #171717, white 10 %)."
      ],
      "key": "surface",
      "name": "Surface / Bubble",
      "no_analogue_reason": "",
      "shadcn_url": "https://ui.shadcn.com/docs/components/card",
      "sizing": "stretchable",
      "states": [
        "plain",
        "focused"
      ],
      "status": "implemented",
      "theme_coverage": [
        "light",
        "dark"
      ],
      "tier": "A"
    },
    {
      "deviations": [
        "Font: Segoe UI Variable Text (native system font per the design system) instead of Geist; glyph widths differ slightly.",
        "Body is 14/400 vs shadcn typography p 16/28: the floating shell uses control text size (text-sm, as Input/Textarea/Button) for running text.",
        "Muted is 12/400 vs shadcn muted 14/20: Mascot's muted is the caption size (text-xs, as Badge/Tooltip). Colour matches muted-foreground (#737373 / #A1A1A1).",
        "Label 14/500 matches shadcn small (14/500); line height is DirectWrite natural rather than leading-none."
      ],
      "key": "typography",
      "name": "Typography / Label",
      "no_analogue_reason": "",
      "shadcn_url": "https://ui.shadcn.com/docs/components/typography",
      "sizing": "content-sized",
      "states": [
        "body",
        "muted",
        "label",
        "caption",
        "tooltip"
      ],
      "status": "implemented",
      "theme_coverage": [
        "light",
        "dark"
      ],
      "tier": "A"
    },
    {
      "deviations": [
        "Upstream Lucide 0.544.0 geometry converted at build time to Direct2D paths (no SVG parser or icon font at runtime).",
        "16 DIP viewport, stroke-width 2 in the 24-unit art box, round caps/joins, current foreground colour — same as lucide-react at size-4."
      ],
      "key": "icon",
      "name": "Icon",
      "no_analogue_reason": "shadcn has no icon component; the canonical reference is the upstream Lucide set (mascot-icons/source/ provenance)",
      "shadcn_url": null,
      "sizing": "fixed",
      "states": [
        "16 DIP"
      ],
      "status": "implemented",
      "theme_coverage": [
        "light",
        "dark"
      ],
      "tier": "A"
    },
    {
      "deviations": [
        "No outline icon button: Mascot uses primary 32 DIP (Send/Stop) and ghost 28 DIP (Copy) instead of shadcn's 36 px size-icon (outline in the example) — compact sizes that fit the 52 DIP single-line composer.",
        "Disabled uses explicit muted fill + muted-foreground icon instead of disabled:opacity-50 (one flat colour pair, no Direct2D opacity layer).",
        "Pressed is an extra state (stronger accent mix); shadcn defines no pressed treatment.",
        "Focus-visible matches shadcn: 3 DIP ring at 50 % alpha + 1 DIP ring-coloured border."
      ],
      "key": "icon-button",
      "name": "IconButton",
      "no_analogue_reason": "",
      "shadcn_url": "https://ui.shadcn.com/docs/components/button",
      "sizing": "fixed",
      "states": [
        "default",
        "hover",
        "pressed",
        "focus-visible",
        "disabled"
      ],
      "status": "implemented",
      "theme_coverage": [
        "light",
        "dark"
      ],
      "tier": "A"
    },
    {
      "deviations": [
        "Default fill is primary #171717 / #E5E5E5 from the documented shadcn neutral theme (ui.shadcn.com/docs/theming); the live /view examples currently render primary as #000000 in light.",
        "Compact sizes only: sm (32) and default (36); no lg or icon sizes, no outline/link/destructive variants (no product surface needs them).",
        "Disabled uses explicit muted fill + muted-foreground text instead of disabled:opacity-50.",
        "Pressed is an extra state; focus-visible ring matches shadcn (3 DIP ring/50 + 1 DIP ring border).",
        "Width differs from the reference only by glyph metrics (Segoe UI Variable vs Geist), e.g. \"Secondary\" 98 vs 102 px; height, padding and radius match."
      ],
      "key": "button",
      "name": "Button",
      "no_analogue_reason": "",
      "shadcn_url": "https://ui.shadcn.com/docs/components/button",
      "sizing": "content-sized",
      "states": [
        "default",
        "secondary",
        "ghost",
        "disabled",
        "focus-visible",
        "hover",
        "pressed"
      ],
      "status": "implemented",
      "theme_coverage": [
        "light",
        "dark"
      ],
      "tier": "A"
    },
    {
      "deviations": [
        "Size matches (28 DIP high, 6/12 padding, 8 DIP radius, 12/400), but colours use primary/primary-foreground (#171717/#FAFAFA, dark #E5E5E5/#171717) instead of shadcn's foreground/background (#0A0A0A/#FFFFFF, dark #FAFAFA/#0A0A0A). No product reason — follow-up candidate, left unchanged here to keep foundation pixels identical.",
        "No arrow.",
        "Single line, bounded at 240 DIP with an end ellipsis; the shadcn tooltip wraps.",
        "Opens after a 500 ms hover (native timer)."
      ],
      "key": "tooltip",
      "name": "Tooltip",
      "no_analogue_reason": "",
      "shadcn_url": "https://ui.shadcn.com/docs/components/tooltip",
      "sizing": "content-sized",
      "states": [
        "shown"
      ],
      "status": "implemented",
      "theme_coverage": [
        "light",
        "dark"
      ],
      "tier": "A"
    },
    {
      "deviations": [
        "The composer is the rounded bubble (14 DIP radius, composited shadow) holding a windowless RichEdit and the Send icon button, not a bordered textarea (8 px radius, shadow-xs, transparent fill).",
        "Single line is 52 DIP high and grows to 6 lines (152 DIP) then scrolls, vs textarea min-h-16 (64 px) with field-sizing-content.",
        "Focus turns the 1 DIP border ring-coloured (as shadcn border-ring) without the 3 px ring/50 halo, which would spill outside the bubble and under the mascot.",
        "No disabled state; the nearest state is submitting: editor read-only with dimmed text and Send replaced by Stop.",
        "Text 14/400 with a 20 DIP line matches textarea md:text-sm; Enter submits, Shift+Enter inserts a newline."
      ],
      "key": "composer",
      "name": "Native Text Input / Composer",
      "no_analogue_reason": "",
      "shadcn_url": "https://ui.shadcn.com/docs/components/textarea",
      "sizing": "stretchable",
      "states": [
        "empty",
        "focused",
        "text",
        "selection",
        "multiline",
        "overflow",
        "submitting"
      ],
      "status": "implemented",
      "theme_coverage": [
        "light",
        "dark"
      ],
      "tier": "A"
    },
    {
      "deviations": [
        "Horizontal only; 1 DIP hairline in the border token (#E5E5E5 / white 10 %), snapped to one device pixel at every DPI — matches shadcn separator."
      ],
      "key": "separator",
      "name": "Separator",
